WEBVTT

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.580
That woman...

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.120
She's from Lacuna.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.910
They are going to Lost, too?

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.250
Let's hurry.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.500
Yes.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:10.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:16.950
"Episode 11: Trust"

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:19.450
That antenna, huh?

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.620
This is reckless.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:27.250
In order for them to maintain
their sanity within Lost,

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:30.950
we must continue to call
out to them without pause.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.830
But, how?

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:36.700
We will use Lacuna's
facilities to our advantage.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:41.290
We will hack into their system
and use their antenna remotely.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:45.870
For that, we must take control
of their server room.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.830
We have intruders.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.410
Hurry!

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.830
Quickly!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.660
"Horned Owl Transport"

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.040
Okay on this side!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.160
Geek, go ahead.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:31.620
Roger!

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:35.410
All right! I haven't gone all out in a while!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.250
Shit...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:51.830
Are they predicting our movements?

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.700
You!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.000
Mr. Takuya!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.910
Yoshiaki!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.620
Hey, Yuki!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.700
How are you?

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.450
Why are you all here?!

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.330
Take this!

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:45.250
With that, you should be able to
stay connected with us from Lost!

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.790
Mr. Geek and everyone are
desperately making preparations!

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.000
Huh?

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.410
Here they come!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.040
Leave the rest to us!

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.620
Everyone...

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:20.330
We should reach Lost soon. Please prepare.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:21.370
Suzuna.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.700
Yes.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.620
Thank you for everything until now.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:26.040
Huh?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.290
I appreciate all the work you have done.

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:34.700
I am undeserving of such words.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.540
"Overseeing Director Office"

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.000
There's no end!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:14.080
It's been a few hours since he was shot.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:16.910
What the hell is happening?!

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:30.910
What happened? Respond! Respond!

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.700
It'll be bad if we don't hurry!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:38.200
That's saying it nicely!
What's taking Geek so long?!

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.950
Mr. Keigo, can you hear me?

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.700
Shut down the power to the entire facility!

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.200
If we do that, the server room...

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.080
Just do it!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.750
It seems Taiyo is heading toward Lost.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:53.000
We can't allow him to get in
the way of Takuya and Yuki.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.830
Geek, have you finished the decryption?

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:57.910
I'm working on it!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.910
But I can't keep up with the load!

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:03.290
"Password Decryption In-Process"
But I can't keep up with the load!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.950
Do you really plan to go alone?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.080
You'll get involved if you stay here.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:18.870
Whether you stay or immediately
retreat is up to you.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:40.830
"Fail"

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:03.870
I will get revenge for all the people...
you have sacrificed until now!

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.120
Back-up electricity?

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.500
This huge company can even make
a bawling child stop in fear.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.620
They can't let the servers drop,
even if they die.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.120
Now the doors won't open.

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:30.040
A true siege, by definition.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:04.500
Taiyo has entered Lost...

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.620
Hang in there!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:21.870
Yuki, I made you go through so much pain...

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:28.000
Suzuna...

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:32.450
This is... what I deserve.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.200
Go. Hurry.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:46.540
You even shot your own subordinate...

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:51.500
Shit!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.120
Hey, there!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.120
Kana?!

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.870
I'm in the academy borough right now!

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:01.200
Huh? Who cares?!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.290
The tech here is really state of the art!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:06.370
So what?! I'm busy right now!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:10.160
I took the liberty of connecting you
to the university's supercomputer!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.120
Supercomputer?

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.450
Oh! That's a great idea!

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:21.160
You've got the skills, but you're bad at
following through! You've gotta be more sly!

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.040
Now, let's do this!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.250
"Password Decryption In-Process"

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.910
"Password Decryption In-Process"
The parallel processing ramped
up the decryption speed!

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:33.290
Thanks! This'll do it!

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.870
Takuya! Yuki!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:38.950
Geek!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.870
Sorry for the wait!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.250
We're going to enter Lost now!
I'm depending on your support!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.830
Yeah!

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:48.450
Also... both of you...

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.580
Make sure you come back alive!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:01.620
I'm sure that if it's those two...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:09.040
Go!

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:46.410
Give it a rest already!

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:53.700
I'm not going.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.750
You're right.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.330
I have no right to act so high and mighty...

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:08.290
My dad was also involved in the Lost.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.330
Day after day. Work. Work.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:15.660
I knew that being a
police officer was hard work.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.790
Even so, I was lonely.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:25.040
It's been three years since Lost.
There are a lot of people who've given up.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:28.700
But I won't give up.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:32.040
I believe my father is alive.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:37.200
Everyone disappeared.

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:42.540
That's reality. I'm so tired now.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.120
Souma is...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:50.870
As long as you head
toward Lost, he'll appear again.

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:55.370
You'll have to fight your little brother.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:13:02.660
Are you prepared for that?
If not, don't involve Takuya any further.

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:06.830
That wasn't my little brother...

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:11.160
I'm sick of this. I don't care what happens.

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:16.830
My father. Souma. Even Takuya.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.660
I don't care about them anymore!

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.830
I want to rest!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:24.080
--Yuki!
--Yuki!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:27.080
Yuki! Listen to me.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:32.950
You... You aren't that weak.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.330
Yuki, hold on...

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.540
My head feels like it's going to split open...

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.500
Shit...

00:13:59.290 --> 00:14:00.700
Kouta!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.330
Stop it!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.910
This is my job.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.910
I heard you're a courier.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:46.120
I kill. You deliver. That's all.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:52.660
How am I different? We're all part
of the gears. Puppets of fate.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:59.410
You and me. In the end, we can't do anything.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:09.830
Hey, don't go to Lost anymore.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:14.410
I can't stand watching you get hurt.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:18.120
There's no guarantee that
you'll come back alive.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:22.290
I don't want to regret things again...

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:27.250
At that time... That time...

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.330
What do you mean we're stopping?!

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:33.870
Just like I said. There's no longer any
need to go undercover at the academy.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.290
The reason?

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.830
It's already been decided.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.580
I can't accept this! I am so close to the truth!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:46.580
Remember this, Takuya. We aren't the police.

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:49.660
And, we're definitely not heroes of justice.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:52.370
Mr. Kaibara!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:59.750
Someone gave us circus tickets.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.830
Would you like to come with us?

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:17.620
This is the past... I can't change the past...

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:28.160
Will I let people die again...?
Then, it's better if I go, too.

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:31.830
I don't want to have regrets...

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:34.790
Yeah. I'll go.

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:38.330
You can't, Takuya! Takuya!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.040
The white noise...

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:44.700
Our voices may no longer be reaching them...

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:48.000
Takuya! Takuya!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.080
Takuya!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:54.410
Takuya!

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:58.450
Yuki!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:37.910
You're there, aren't you, Daichi.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:45.330
"I didn't think you'd come
here personally, Taiyo."

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:52.830
I'd like to reminisce about the
past with you, but I have no time.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:59.080
I have to erase you completely
and finish the portal.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:02.200
Answer me, Takuya!

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:06.040
We can only believe in their bond now.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:10.450
As long as they continue supporting each other,
their memories will stay intact.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:13.790
If one of them falters, then...

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.330
Takuya, are you all right?

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.910
Takuya!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.080
Hey, Geek.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.830
Well, let's go.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.330
Don't give me that! Are you okay?!

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:33.700
No problem.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.870
Of course there is!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.790
Who was that girl?

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.660
How would I know?!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:04.700
So tired. My whole body hurts.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:09.120
What was I doing again...?

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:12.870
Well, who cares.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:18.950
In the end, I couldn't do anything...

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.040
Hey.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.200
Hm?

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:27.120
What is normal life to you, Takuya?

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:33.870
Having a place to stay, a place to work,
and some friends to be with.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:35.330
How normal.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:38.120
Normal is the best kind of happiness.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:41.830
I see. You're right.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:45.290
Once everything is over,
I want to live a normal life.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.290
Who is this girl?

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:50.250
I wonder what place would
be the best place to live?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:52.700
A place with a good view.

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:58.950
A house where you can see the sea.
I'd like a cat, too.

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:03.040
A big window would be good.
The cat would be happy, too.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.580
I wonder what color the curtains should be.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:06.540
Blue.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:11.120
What? A blue sea behind blue curtains?

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:14.040
Huh? Who are you?

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.750
Oh, you're right. Then, green.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:23.950
That would be nice.
The furniture should match well, too.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:26.790
I've always dreamed of living
in a fashionable house.

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:29.330
I'll come visit sometimes.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.500
I'll make you something to eat.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.830
--Just some coffee and bread is enough.

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.040
--Now that I think about it. I'm pretty hungry...
--Just some coffee and bread is enough.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.330
--Now that I think about it. I'm pretty hungry...
--What are you saying?

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:38.410
It has to be white rice and miso soup!

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.500
The traditional Japanese food-type.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:45.000
It must be wonderful. A normal life.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.040
Yeah.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.160
I have to try my best not to forget.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:52.200
Yeah. No matter what happens.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:56.410
Let's not forget about living a happy life.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:27.370
Takuya, thank you!

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:29.080
I...

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.080
It's thanks to you!

00:21:35.250 --> 00:21:39.750
Even in that form, you haven't changed.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.250
Taiyo!

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.790
Father?!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:57.120
Stop it!

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:37.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:23:43.450 --> 00:23:46.290
Next Episode: "Future."
